  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Centers for Civic Initiative (CCI)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Centers for Civic Initiative (CCI)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objectives of the Core support are CCI&apos;s main strategic priorities defined by
its Strategic plan 20222027, which revolve around the following impact areas: Good
governance and citizen participation; Countering corruption and misuse of public
resources; The rule of law and election processes: EU integration; Sustainable civil
society. The submitted strategic plan accompanied with the well-elaborated budget are
acceptable for Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
